fields.value:
{{Disjointnotes
| name = Moon Glaives
| desc = The projectile does not bounce when [[disjoint]]ed by the primary attacked unit.<br><br>When disjointed by a secondary target, it is not registed as a projectile impact. The attack may immediately bounce on it again if it is within the search radius.<br><br>Other bounce limit ability notes apply.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-to}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{to}} ... {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** [[File:Dota2 Luna Moon Glaives Bounce icon-1.png|84px|Moon Glaives Bounce Visualized]][[File:Dota2 Luna Moon Glaives Bounce icon-2.png|84px|Moon Glaives Bounce Visualized]]
*** The successful attack bounces toward a random enemy unit within [[Wikipedia:Circle|circle]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-b.png|B|21px]] , centered around the the primary attacked enemy unit [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] , without priorities.
*** The attacks may bounce back to the same units if it hits all other valid enemy units per attack.
*** All ability notes apply to subsequent bounces, centered around the {{Code|n + 1}}<sup>th</sup> attacked enemy unit, until the following the conditions:
**** Reaching the max number of bounces.
**** When no other targets are available, nothing happens.
** {{cf|Level|4}} Has the following ability values per bounced damage:
*** Can affect other enemy units at the following theoretical max distance with the [[attack range]] and the secondary target search radius.
:: {{{!}} class="wikitable" style="text-align:center; margin-top:3px; font-size:80%;"
! style="width:150px" {{!}} n<sup>th</sup> Bounce
! style="width:90px" {{!}} 1
! style="width:90px" {{!}} 2
! style="width:90px" {{!}} 3
! style="width:90px" {{!}} 4
! style="width:90px" {{!}} 5
! style="width:90px" {{!}} 6
{{!}}-
{{!}} {{Code|× f([[Physical|Dmg]])}}
{{!}} {{#invoke:Lua|invoke|module=loop|fn=p|1|6|<nowiki>{{#expr:{{#explode:{{#var:Moon Glaives value4}}|/|3}}^{{#var:p}} round4}}
{{!}}</nowiki>}}-
{{!}} {{Symbol|bonus atk|size=17px}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe|size=17px}} Max Distance
{{!}} {{#invoke:Lua|invoke|module=loop|fn=d|1|6|<nowiki>{{#expr:{{Show|H|Luna|atkrange}}+{{#var:Moon Glaives value1}}*{{#var:d}}}}
{{!}}</nowiki>}}-
{{!}}}

* {{Symbol|Damage|Physical}} {{Symbol|Spell Damage}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The bounce projectile applies {{M|physical}} {{M|spell damage}}, and is defined as:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Spell Damage|SpellDmg]] {{=}} ( ( ( (Min[[Base Attack Damage|Base]]Atk + Max[[Base Attack Damage|Base]]Atk) / 2 + Σ[[Agility|Agi]]) × [[Critical Strike|Crit]]Factor) × f([[Physical|Dmg]]) ^ n )}}
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Flag}}
*** The spell damage applied has the following damage flag:
**** {{M|No-spell-amplification}}
** Does not interact with the following sources:
*** After reductions-type damage manipulation sources.
** Interacts with the following sources:
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**** Bonus {{M|conditional attack damage}} sources that are explicitly considered by {{M|critical strike}} sources.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** Before reductions-type [[damage manipulation]] sources.
**** {{M|Damage block}} sources.
**** {{M|Instant kills}} the {{U|Undying Zombie}}.
**** Specifically {{A|Mars|Bulwark}}, but not the {{A|Void Spirit|Resonant Pulse}} {{M|damage barrier|t=phy|text=physical damage barrier}} component.

* {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-to}} 
** Bounces to the following units:
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Outposts}}
*** {{M|Untargetable}} units.
** Does not bounce to the following units:
*** {{M|Attack immune}} units.
*** {{M|Couriers}}
*** {{M|Fogged units}}.
*** {{M|Invisible}} units.
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Bounce-off}}
*** Bounces off upon attacking the following units:
**** {{M|Couriers|x}}
**** {{M|Ward-type units|x}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Moon Glaives icon0}}
| desc = Empowers Luna's glaives, causing her attacks to bounce between enemy units. Deals less damage with each bounce.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Increases Luna's outgoing damage by {{calc|v1*(1-v1^v2)/(1-v1) round4|v1={{#var:Moon Glaives value4}}|v2={{#var:Moon Glaives value2}}|%}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*(1-v1^v2)/(1-v1) round4|v1={{#var:Moon Glaives value4 tal}}|v2={{#var:Moon Glaives value2}}|%}}|10tal}}) if all bounces hit ([[before reductions]]).
** Has the following additional properties:
*** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
**** Luna's glaive permanently emits blue particles visible to everyone upon learning the ability.
**** The bounce projectile is cosmetically identical to Luna's attack projectile.
*** {{Symbol|Projectile|Speed}}
**** For Luna, the bounce [[projectile speed]] is {{Show|H|Luna|projectile speed}}.
***** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|BounceSpeed {{=}} HeroCurrent[[Projectile Speed|ProjectileSpeed]]}}
*** {{Symbol|Melee}}
**** For [[melee]] attacks, Moon Glaives uses a {{M|projectile}} after the primary attack.
**** For melee units, if the enemy target is {{G|melee miss range}}-distance farther than the attacker's {{M|attack range}}, the attack will {{M|miss}} regardless.

